<title>USA: Praegitzer names Thale CFO.</title>
<headline>Praegitzer names Thale CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Praegitzer Industries Inc said Friday it had named William Thale, former controller for its Praegitzer Design division, as its new chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Thale succeeds Matt Bergeron, who was named chief operating officer and executive vice president.</p>
<p>Praegitzer is a leading designer and fabricator of advanced printed circuit boards.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
